            "value": "Mover para cima"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moves the mouse pointer with the controller's motion while the activation key allows it. Needs DInput mode and the Accessibility permission; apply the profile so the controller knows the gyro is in use.": {
      "localizations": {
